" ==============================================================================
" IDEA Vim Configuration (Adapted for VS Code Vim Habits)
" ==============================================================================

" --- Basic Settings ---
set number              " Show line numbers (nu)
set relativenumber      " Relative line numbers (optional, VS Code users often prefer)
set scrolloff=5         " Scroll offset
set incsearch           " Incremental search
set hlsearch            " Highlight search results
set ignorecase          " Ignore case in search
set smartcase           " Smart case sensitivity
set clipboard=unnamed   " Use system clipboard

" --- Leader Key Settings ---
" Keep consistent with VS Code, use space as Leader
let mapleader=" "

" --- General Mappings (VS Code Style Adaptation) ---

" 1. Clear search highlight (ESC)
nnoremap <Esc> :noh<CR>

" 2. Code Navigation & Info (Core Mappings)
" gh: Show hover info / type hints (VS Code: ShowHoverInfo -> IDEA: QuickImplementations / ShowErrorDescription)
" Mapped to 'QuickImplementations' (shows docs/type), closest to VS Code Hover experience
nnoremap gh :action QuickImplementations<CR>

" gd: Go to definition (GotoDeclaration)
nnoremap gd :action GotoDeclaration<CR>

" gi: Go to implementation (GotoImplementation)
nnoremap gi :action GotoImplementation<CR>

" gr: Find references (ShowUsages)
nnoremap gr :action FindUsages<CR>

" gf: Format code (FormatCode)
" Note: In IDEA, the Action ID for Reformat Code is typically ReformatCode
nnoremap gf :action ReformatCode<CR>

" 3. UI Controls
" <leader>e: Open project view (ActivateProjectToolWindow)
nnoremap <leader>e :action ActivateProjectToolWindow<CR>

" <leader>f: Find file (GotoFile / Search Everywhere)
" In IDEA, 'SearchEverywhere' is more powerful, or use 'GotoFile'
nnoremap <leader>f :action GotoFile<CR>

" 4. Refactoring
" <leader>rn: Rename symbol (RenameElement)
nnoremap <leader>rn :action RenameElement<CR>

" <leader>ca: Show intention actions / quick fix (ShowIntentionActions / Alt+Enter)
nnoremap <leader>ca :action ShowIntentionActions<CR>

" 5. Editor Tab / Window Management
" <leader>w: Close current tab (CloseContent)
nnoremap <leader>w :action CloseContent<CR>

" L / H: Switch to next / previous tab (NextTab / PreviousTab)
nnoremap L :action NextTab<CR>
nnoremap H :action PreviousTab<CR>

" --- Clipboard Behavior (VS Code Style) ---
" When pasting in visual mode, do not overwrite register (keep replaced content out of clipboard)
" Note: IDEA Vim support for "_dP depends on version, try alternative if invalid
vnoremap p "_dP
vnoremap P "_dP

" --- Additional Optimizations (Optional) ---
" Make j/k move by visual lines in long lines (VS Code default behavior)
nnoremap j gj
nnoremap k gk
vnoremap j gj
vnoremap k gk

" --- Visual Mode Leader Mappings ---
" Rename (supports renaming after visual selection)
vnoremap <leader>rn :action RenameElement<CR>

" Format code (visual mode)
vnoremap gf :action ReformatCode<CR>